// The tutorial: a dip to learn jumping, a chasm with a floor and a stone, the bloom as a slab, a dip and a step to the door.
name First Bloom
rule B1234/S012345678
steps 2
hint Something bloomed from the stone down in the chasm. Stand on the stone, press E to plant, jump back up to the left, then Grow. The bloom is solid ground.
tip The origin is the cell you stand in on the stone. Growth takes whatever stands inside it: be back on the rock before you grow.
intro You wake at the edge of a chasm with a lantern in your hand. Across it, the faint outline of something that once grew. It grew from one point. It can again.
outro The ground remembers. Where you planted the seed, the bloom grew back, and it holds your weight.
map
